{
  "subsystem": "RuleModel",
  "title":     "Game Rule Constants",
  "targets":   {
    "cfg": "ckf.hardmode.cfg",
    "overlays": [
      "ckf.hardmode.d/RuleModel.csv"
    ]
  },
  "enable":    { "cfg": "Slices.RuleModel" },

  "doc": [
    "Slice toggle. Off: Slices.VerdictForOverlay skips every file below before",
    "it is opened, so none of its rows reach RulePlan. These files are loaded",
    "by the row-edit engine, so they also have no effect while [Slices]",
    "ModelRules is off (ModelRules.Init returns before Overlays.Load).",
    "",
    "Files this toggle gates:",
    "  RuleModel.csv",
    "",
    "Direct overlay on RuleModel: RuleId plus Value; a blank Value leaves the",
    "row alone. In the game data RuleModel has 76 rows, ids 1-76",
    "contiguous, every Value an integer from -50 to 400 [measured,",
    "sheets/raw/RuleModel.csv]."
  ],

  "uiDoc": [
    "Turn this off and the mod skips this page's files, so nothing on this page is applied."
  ],

  "fields": [
    {
      "path": "Slices.RuleModel", "in": "cfg", "type": "bool",
      "default": true, "ui": "form",
      "label": "Enable Game Rule Constants",
      "doc": "On applies RuleModel.csv; off skips it before it is opened. Default true.",
      "uiDoc": "Turn this off and the mod skips this page's files, so nothing on this page is applied."
    },
